resources.string:
Place the material on the laser engraving and cutting platform. Based on the work origin and work area, the machine will calculate the material’s position. Then, the machien will move the toolhead to measure the material’s thickness, based on which the machine adjusts the laser height.

Conditions that might cause thickness measurement failure:
The material thickness is over 50 mm;
The material texture is transparent, or the material surface is glossy or specular;
The material color is red or black;
The material is hollow.
